# <type>: <imperative summary, <= 72 chars>
#
# Types: feat | fix | refactor | perf | test | docs | build | ci | chore | release
#
# Why, not what — the diff already shows what. Explain the reasoning a reader
# cannot recover from the code, and name the evidence:
#
#   Evidence: build clean; typecheck 0 errors; suite 111/111.
#
# One blank line between the summary and the body. This repository credits
# exactly one author (Dhira Wigata <dwigata.putra@gmail.com>), so no
# Co-authored-by, no "Generated with ...", no agent bylines — .githooks/commit-msg
# refuses them. Signed-off-by is fine.